# The green LED through the radio chip: on, off, blinking, each confirmed by
# the user; then left as the firmware started (off, the chip powered down).
@debug
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key o
say "^WARN  Gate overridden" 100
sayn 2 "^Press a key" 300
key g
say "^Starting the radio chip" 500
say "^  radio chip started in \d+ ms" 1000
say "^Is the green LED on" 500
key y
say "^Is the green LED off now" 500
key y
say "^Is the green LED blinking" 500
key y
say "^PASS  The green LED works" 500
log "LED: off, the radio chip powered down" 500
